ide\0452C\04520such\04520as\04520timelines\0452C\04520before\055and\055after\04520comparisons\0452C\04520charts\0452C\04520or\04520process\04520diagrams\056\04520Pause\04520for\04520approval\056\0450A\0450AAfter\04520approval\0452C\04520create\04520the\04520presentation\04520if\04520available\056\04520Follow\04520my\04520design\04520guidance\0452C\04520keep\04520the\04520tone\04520constructive\04520and\04520evidence\055based\0452C\04520translate\04520lessons\04520into\04520concrete\04520changes\04520or\04520next\04520steps\0452C\04520and\04520identify\04520owners\04520where\04520the\04520sources\04520support\04520them\056)
